  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "からだの　おくから　はどうの　ちからを\nあいてに　うちはなつ。\nこうげきは　かならず　めいちゅう　する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "몸속에서 파동의 힘을\n끌어내 상대에게 쏜다.\n공격은 반드시 명중한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "將來自體內深處的波導之力\n擊向對手。\n攻擊必定會命中。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur dégage une aura et projette de l’énergie.\nN’échoue jamais.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tief aus dem Inneren des Anwenders löst sich ein\nkraftvoller Stoß Aura-Energie. Diese Attacke trifft\ngarantiert.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Libera, desde su interior, una inmensa descarga de aura.\nEs infalible.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa rilascia una forza eterea dal profondo\ndel corpo. La mossa è infallibile.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user lets loose a blast of aura power from deep\nwithin its body at the target. This attack\nnever misses.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "体の　奥から　波導の　力を\n相手に　うち放つ。\n攻撃は　必ず　命中する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "从体内产生出波导之力，\n然后向对手发出。\n攻击必定会命中。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Libera, desde su interior, una inmensa descarga de aura.\nEs infalible.",
      "version_group": {
